#!/bin/bash
# lateralus override — upstream is a pacman fzf picker; on lateralus new
# software comes from brew (CLI) or Flathub (GUI).

# omarchy:summary=Explain how to install new software on lateralus

cat << EOF
This is an immutable bootc image — new software doesn't come from the
system package manager:

  CLI tools:  brew search <term>   → brew install <name>
  GUI apps:   flatpak search <term> → flatpak install <name>
  Baked in:   add to the image (Brewfile / flatpak list / build scripts)
              and rebuild — see ujust --list for shortcuts

EOF
